# SEO Sitemap and Robots.txt Configuration

## Description
This project focuses on SEO configuration for website deployment using sitemap.xml and robots.txt.

## Technologies
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- XML
- Netlify
- GitHub

## Files
- index.html
- style.css
- script.js
- sitemap.xml
- robots.txt

## How to Run
1. Open the project folder.
2. Open index.html in a browser.
3. Deploy the website using Netlify.

